@4311   = ~~ [YESLK26]
@4312   = ~The mines were there for anyone who looked! I'll not be blamed for what the Throne does with 'em!~ [YESLK27]
@4313   = ~ 'Twould be good if you tithed a few coins now and then. The favor of gods is worth a few gold.~ [YESLK28]
@4314   = ~You've sold your mores for the love of gold. All dwarves are kin, but I'll not call YOU family.~ [YESLK29]
