@4629   = ~Mr. Ployer,
We have prepared the necessary spells and await your order. Our normal efficiency has been forgone in favor of, as you said, "increased pain and suffering." Your payment was received, and though it should have been more, given your continued financial difficulty, it will suffice for now. We will strike when you have located her.

Terrece~
