@5178   = ~Think as you act, fool.~ [SIRIN07]
@5179   = ~I see. It is something of a curiosity to me. In my profession, Bhaal was once the foremost power. I cannot help but be curious.~
@5180   = ~The trees speak of your presence.~ [DRYAD01]
@5181   = ~Nature knows much of you.~ [DRYAD02]
@5182   = ~The very trees cringe at the sight of thee.~ [DRYAD03]
@5183   = ~Statue~
@5184   = ~Leave my wood!~ [DRYAD04]
@5185   = ~Statue~
@5186   = ~Do as I bid!~ [DRYAD05]
@5187   = ~Protect me!~ [DRYAD06]
@5188   = ~Thy will is mine!~ [DRYAD07]
@5189   = ~True beauty lies only in nature.~ [NYMPH02]
@5190   = ~Help! I am beset by evil!~ [NYMPH03]
@5191   = ~The power core of the sphere roars to life, distorting space as it races through the planes. After a few minutes, the sphere lurches, the power fades, and the power core fizzles. The sphere has taken its last planar jaunt.~
@5192   = ~Monsters! Attack me not!~ [NYMPH04]
@5193   = ~Ahhh... to be in the waters of home. Hmm... mm.~ [NERED01]
@5194   = ~Leave me be, silly dirt-fish.~ [NERED02]
@5195   = ~You men cannot hurt me.~ [NERED03]
@5196   = ~I hope my master appreciates my effort.~
@5197   = ~I'd rather be swimming.~ [NERED04]
@5198   = ~You've not the time for this!~ [VOICE01]
@5199   = ~<DAMAGEE> was immune to my damage.~
@5200   = ~Leave him. Get the claw!~ [VOICE02]
@5201   = ~ 'Tis the horn you seek! Claim what should be yours!~ [VOICE03]
@5202   = ~It's of no concern who it's truly for—take what is meant for you!~ [VOICE04]
@5203   = ~Forget the old man! His time is past! The wish should be yours!~ [VOICE05]
@5204   = ~Use it yourself, and know the legacy of your true father!~ [VOICE06]
@5205   = ~Seek the dagger next! It is nearby in the hands of a great evil ogre!~ [VOICE07]
@5206   = ~Look at them! The knight is obviously the one to help!~ [VOICE08]
@5207   = ~The beast is an ogre! They are evil; they cannot be otherwise!~ [VOICE09]
@5208   = ~The potion you seek is here!~ [VOICE10]
@5209   = ~Ignore him! Drink the potion yourself, and know the essence of your heritage!~ [VOICE11]
@5210   = ~It is the last item you seek! Of course you're worthy of it!~ [VOICE12]
@5211   = ~You know you are all that and more!~ [VOICE13]
@5212   = ~You have done well by your heritage.~ [VOICE14]
@5213   = ~You are most disappointing indeed.~ [VOICE15]
@5214   = ~I am the essence of Bhaal within you.~ [VOICE16]
@5215   = ~Fight, that the violent death of your mind shall pave the way!~ [VOICE17]
@5216   = ~Weakling fool! You have spurned your father's gifts and your heritage. You can only pay with your blood!~ [VOICE18]
@5217   = ~You will not prevail! The strength that was given returns to the source! I am the stronger!~ [VOICE19]
@5218   = ~You have balanced the scales with your actions, but the Return cannot be stopped!~ [VOICE20]
@5219   = ~The Return will not be stopped. The Return will not be stopped! The Return will not... be... stopped...~ [VOICE21]
@5220   = ~Help! I need your aid! There are too many!~ [WARRI01]
