@5222   = ~I don't want to die alone...~ [WARRI03]
@5223   = ~Thank you...~ [WARRI04]
@5224   = ~Salutations! I have come looking for someone, to deliver a gift. A horn, actually.~ [MESSN01]
@5225   = ~I seek the First Reader of this great library. Perhaps you have seen him?~ [MESSN02]
@5226   = ~Then I bear a message for you as well.~ [MESSN03]
@5227   = ~Young one! Please stop awhile. I need your help.~ [SORCR01]
@5228   = ~This candle is my last chance, child. Please... bring it to me.~ [SORCR02]
@5229   = ~Thank you. I am renewed.~ [SORCR03]
@5230   = ~Me no beast! Me don't want fight! Go 'way!~ [TOGRE01]
@5231   = ~Shiny man attack ME! I be good, but he make fight!~ [TOGRE02]
@5232   = ~You no hurt me, me no hurt you! Me don't care if me born bad!~ [TOGRE03]
@5233   = ~You there! Help me dispose of this beast!~ [WKNIG01]
@5234   = ~Don't believe a word it says! Born evil they are! Everyone knows that!~ [WKNIG02]
@5235   = ~You chose right! Beings of flesh are what they are. There is no escaping your destiny!~ [WKNIG03]
@5236   = ~Please... that pack of gnolls... they poisoned me.~ [POISN01]
@5237   = ~Please... show some charity... I'll die without it.~ [POISN02]
