@5347   = ~Could we not have hired some poor fools to do this for us? This is no place for a man of my stature.~ [EDWIN18]
@5348   = ~Another day and more aimless stumbling about.~ [EDWIN19]
@5349   = ~Intelligent peoples do not wander around looking for trouble in the evening hours.~ [EDWIN20]
