@7357   = ~Dark Lord Hertious, undead Warlord of Bane, wore this piece of armor for over five hundred years. During this time he was rumored to dwell in a castle somewhere within the Earthfast Mountains. How his armor moved to other lands without him is not certain, though the separation of the two was surely unpleasant.

