@10677  = ~The Lord of Murder shall perish, but in his doom he shall spawn a score of mortal progeny. Chaos will be sewn from their passage. So sayeth the wise Alaundo.~ [CHANT05]
@10678  = ~When shadows descend upon the lands, our divine lords will walk alongside us as equals. So sayeth the great Alaundo.~ [CHANT02]
@10679  = ~The Wyrm shall wander the earth, and such a pestilence will follow in his wake that all that know of his passing shall be struck down by the plague. So sayeth the wise Alaundo.~ [CHANT03]
@10680  = ~When conflict sweeps across the Dales, the great lizards of the north shall descend with fire and fury. So sayeth the great Alaundo.~ [CHANT04]
@10681  = ~In the Year of the Turrets, a great host will come from the east like a plague of locusts. So sayeth the wise Alaundo.~ [CHANT01]
