 Sorcerer~
@11056  = ~Twinkle +3~
@11057  = ~This is a magical scimitar +3 that bears the name Twinkle. It is one of the personal weapons of Drizzt. Due to its magical nature, only those pure of heart can use it.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +2

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d8+3
Damage Type: Slashing
Speed Factor: 2
Proficiency type: Scimitar/Wakizashi/Ninjato
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 8 Strength
 Alignment: Good

Weight: 4

Not usable by:
