 Mage
 Sorcerer~
@11058  = ~Mithral Chain Mail +4~
@11059  = ~This is the personal armor of Drizzt, the famous dark elf ranger. It was forged for him by his friend Bruenor.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 1 (-1 vs. slashing, 3 vs. crushing)
Requires:
 8 Strength

Weight: 7

Not usable by:
 Archer
 Beast Master
 Druid
 Kensai
 Mage
 Monk
