@13769  = ~I sad, but sparkle makes for happy.~
@13770  = ~I not like sad talk. I go sit wit' me pretties.~
@13771  = ~I once had shinies piled up to da sky! I don' remember where dey are though.~
@13772  = ~You find me friends, okay?~
