@16297  = ~The flight arrow, as its name implies, is built for distance. These are lightweight arrows and are often used for hunting. Most of these arrows are made of ash or birch and are thirty to forty inches long. Minor enchantments guarantee better than standard accuracy.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +1
Damage: 1d6
Damage Type: Missile
Launcher: Bow

Weight: 0

