@16301  = ~Phlydia left one of her books in— Oh, you have it already. If you could run it over to her and then come back, I've got some plans for you.~
@16302  = ~The hunt for Valygar Corthala

We have been assaulted by Tolgerias, the Cowled Wizard who was hunting Valygar in an obvious attempt to gain access to the planar sphere. The wizard is dead now... although further repercussions from the Cowled Wizards seem likely.~
