@16677  = ~Getting inside the asylum

A moment of hesitation and all is lost. I think I actually had Desharik going there with my performance of insanity... until I stopped to consider whether or not I really wanted to enter the asylum this way. Desharik grew suspicious and refused, and now I will have to find another way within.~
