@17400  = ~Protection from Evil~
@17401  = ~Protection from Petrification~
@17402  = ~Protection from Missiles~
@17403  = ~Magic Armor~
@17404  = ~Held~
@17405  = ~Sleep~
@17406  = ~Shielded~
@17407  = ~Protection from Fire~
