 Druid
 Mage
 Sorcerer~
@17536  = ~This arrow is coated in acid. When it strikes an enemy, it not only pierces flesh but also eats it away, enlarging and deepening the wound.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +1
Damage: 1d6+1, +1d3 acid damage
Damage Type: Missile
Launcher: Bow

Weight: 0

Not usable by:
