 Druid
 Mage
 Sorcerer~
@17537  = ~This arrow is designed as a deadly complement to the archer. Poison smeared on the barbed arrowhead infiltrates the bloodstream of its victim, causing agony and often death.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Target must save vs. death or lose 30% of its maximum hit points within 20 seconds

Damage: 1d6
Damage Type: Missile
Launcher: Bow

Weight: 0

Not usable by:
 Cleric
 Druid
 Mage
 Sorcerer~
@17538  = ~This arrow has a particularly debilitating effect on its victims as, upon impact, it explodes into a huge ball of fire and shrapnel affecting all within the area.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 6d6 fire damage upon impact (save vs. spell for half)
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Launcher: Bow

Weight: 0

Not usable by:
