 Monk
 Paladin
 Thief~
@17655  = ~A Wand of Frost acts in a similar fashion to the Cone of Cold spell. Crystallized particles of snow and ice fan out from the wand's tip, defining an area wherein the temperature drops to -100 degrees F. Like all wands, the Wand of Frost can only be used a limited number of times before it melts into a harmless pool of water.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Cone of Cold
  Damage: 8d6 cold damage (save vs. wand for half)
  Range: Touch
  Area of Effect: 15-ft. cone

Requires:
 9 Intelligence

Weight: 1

Not usable by:
