@19032  = ~This collar is used to dominate and enslave any individual who wears it. The slaves, or thralls, are usually controlled by the bearer of the Mastery Orb. Once worn, the collar's power cannot be broken except through the use of a Remove Curse spell or the destruction of the mastery orb.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Wearer is dominated
– May only be removed with a Remove Curse spell or through the destruction of the mastery orb

Weight: 5~
