@19486  = ~Margh, there be time fer this battle another day!~ [KORGAN02]
@19487  = ~Aye! This be a grand enough lot... Mayhap I won't be needin' to kill ye all anytime soon! Ha ha ha!~ [KORGAN03]
@19488  = ~I've had better times drownin' face-first in gutter water, bleedin' from every orifice, don'tcha know...~ [KORGAN04]
@19489  = ~Ye'd best change yer tune, fer me axe is itching fer a swing or two an' I be nae likely t' stop it!~ [KORGAN05]
@19490  = ~Ye're all piles o' stinking pigs' bladders! I'll have no more o' this insipid lot!~ [KORGAN06]
@19491  = ~Book of King Strohm III~
@19492  = ~Kalah's blessing upon thee, <LADYLORD>.~
@19493  = ~Aye, now this be more like it! The first t' disobey me orders gets an axe in their skull!~ [KORGAN07]
@19494  = ~When the day be done, the day be done! I wish rest, no argument!~ [KORGAN08]
@19495  = ~If I wished t' sit about all day, I'd do it in a proper pub with an ale in me hand!~ [KORGAN09]
