@19652  = ~Sailor Finch~
@19653  = ~Sailor Al~
@19654  = ~Sailor Al~
@19655  = ~You saved 'at circus, didn't ye? Ye're plain gold, you is!~
@19656  = ~Ye have done what ye have done, there is no denying... The reasons for which are thine, and I trust they are valid—IF ye believe them to be. This is my question, Jaheira: did you do the right thing?~ [TERMIN08]
