@23530  = ~Getting inside the asylum

I convinced one of the courtesans to tell me what happened to Claire. It seems Lady Galvena was not very impressed with the fact that Sanik was going to leave with her, and after having Sanik killed, she had Claire locked up within the guild house.~
@23531  = ~~
@23532  = ~~
@23533  = ~~
