@23642  = ~The Sea Bounty be a nice pub an' all, but if ye steps outside, ye be as likely to have yer pocket picked as not.~
@23643  = ~Renal Bloodscalp be the word here in the docks, mate. Ye hears his name, ye stands up straight and pays yer respect, ye does.~
