 10 Strength

Weight: 7

Not usable by:
 Beast Master
 Cleric
 Druid
 Mage
 Monk
 Sorcerer
 Thief~
@39527  = ~Fullen Woolspinner, an ambitious halfling from a well-to-do family, left his home to spend several years adventuring. During his travels, he ended up staying with a family of dwarven weaponsmiths. Much impressed by their throwing axes, which always returned to the hands of their wielder, Fullen sought to make a dagger that could do the same. With the help of his dwarven friends, he succeeded, creating several of the famous Fullen Boomerang daggers.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Returns to the wielder's hand when thrown

THAC0: +2
Damage: 2d4+2
Damage Type (melee): Piercing
Damage Type (thrown): Missile
