 3 Strength

Weight: 1

Not usable by:
 Beast Master
 Cleric~
@39528  = ~This throwing knife is imbued with magical fire, and was supposedly carved from an extracted red dragon tooth. Tavern tales suggest that the beast is still alive, her anger fueling the enchantment within the weapon. Though fanciful, the story is consistent, and it is said the dagger returns to the thrower "as though on wings."

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Returns to the wielder's hand when thrown

THAC0: +3
Damage: 2d4+3, +1d2 fire damage
