 Thief~
@39538  = ~Hunting gorgons is a highly dangerous drow sport. Often, after a successful hunt, the blood of the gorgon is taken and used in the creation of a new suit of plate. This special type of drow plate is actually able to withstand the light of the surface world. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Fire Resistance: +15%
– Acid Resistance: +15%

