 Stalker
 Thief~
@39559  = ~The dark red metal used to make this chain is said to come from a hidden mine in the Cloudpeaks. At one time the Bloodway, a band of evil adventurers, all wore armor of this kind, but the other suits have long been lost.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 0 (-2 vs. slashing, 2 vs. crushing)
Requires:
 8 Strength

Weight: 7

Not usable by:
