 Bard~
@39564  = ~The lore of this suit is difficult to determine, either due to the exotic circumstances from which it sprang or the wish of its previous owner to conceal its location. Secrecy would certainly be desirable, as even rumors of such a mail as this could provoke deadly interest. It is the pinnacle of elven craft and a truly blessed item.

