@53727  = ~The will of Talos is all-important. Heed... or die.~ [YARRYL01]
@53728  = ~The Stormlord take ye!~ [YARRYL03]
@53729  = ~~ [YARRYL04]
@53730  = ~~ [YARRYL05]
