@54353  = ~Greater Otyugh~
@54354  = ~Those smelly sellswords? I hardly think that they would say such about me. They have no respect for anyone other than Lady Galvena, fearsome wench that she is.~
@54355  = ~Greater Otyugh~
@54356  = ~Small Spider~
@54357  = ~Small Spider~
