@60240  = ~Ribald Barterman at yer service.~ [RIBALD01]
@60241  = ~The Adventurer's Mart's the finest shopping in all of Faerûn: widest selection, lowest prices, and nary a fancy illustration. Just the goods, bare and plain.~ [RIBALD02]
@60242  = ~What can we do to make yer dreams come true today?~ [RIBALD03]
@60243  = ~Peddlers, artisans, or hellspawn, I care nae a blot. All that matters is the deal, and Ribald's here to make one with ya.~ [RIBALD04]
