@60246  = ~It's a cold an' dreary day when the Thumb can't extend a bit o' hospitality to his guests. Come, enter and be welcome at the Sea's Bounty.~ [THUMB01]
@60247  = ~Ahh... a tavern is good fer drinking, singing, and playin'... Anythin' else on yer mind, ye may as well git yerself elsewhere.~ [THUMB02]
@60248  = ~We don't have none o' yer fancy stuff, if ye've a mind. Grog, plain and simple. Anythin' else an' I'll have t' search the cellar.~ [THUMB03]
@60249  = ~Welcome to the Sea's Bounty! Don't ye be mindin' the smell o' fish now.~ [THUMB04]
