@61594  = ~Mercykiller Ring~
@61595  = ~The Mercykillers are a powerful faction based in the planar city of Sigil. This ring is given out to Mercykiller assassins when they are sent out to punish those who have broken the laws of Sigil. Often these assassins will roam as far as the Prime Material Plane. 

