@61599  = ~Robe of Vecna~
@61600  = ~This robe doesn't even come close to the power that the two famous artifacts, the Hand and Eye of Vecna, possess. Still, from simply being worn by the powerful lich, the robe absorbed enough magical energies to become a potent magic item.

