@61601  = ~This fight will continue another day!~ [DRIZZT22]
@61602  = ~Deidre~
@61603  = ~Deidre~
@61604  = ~Joluv~
@61605  = ~Joluv~
@61606  = ~I like the look of you. Welcome!~ [EPRIF01]
@61607  = ~Why do you disturb my meditations?~ [EPRIF02]
@61608  = ~Perhaps the gods have need of you.~ [EPRIF03]
@61609  = ~Please the gods or die as a worm!~ [EPRIF04]
@61610  = ~Your death will come slow and painful.~ [EPRIF05]
@61611  = ~~ [EPRIF06]
@61612  = ~~ [EPRIF07]
@61613  = ~I'll not die for you fools!~ [EPRIF08]
@61614  = ~Greetings. Your power impresses.~ [EPRIM01]
@61615  = ~What do you want amongst the faithful?~ [EPRIM02]
@61616  = ~Bow down before the gods and beg for mercy!~ [EPRIM03]
@61617  = ~The gods are unforgiving, fool!~ [EPRIM04]
@61618  = ~You will pray for death when I am done with you!~ [EPRIM05]
@61619  = ~~ [EPRIM06]
@61620  = ~~ [EPRIM07]
@61621  = ~Mercy! Have mercy!~ [EPRIM08]
@61622  = ~~
@61623  = ~You are nothing before my god!~ [FANATF01]
@61624  = ~Pray and come with us and be found worthy.~ [FANATF02]
@61625  = ~We will be saved in the End.~ [FANATF03]
@61626  = ~I am one with the mighty!~ [FANATF04]
@61627  = ~You are dust before the True God!~ [FANATF05]
@61628  = ~~ [FANATF06]
@61629  = ~~ [FANATF07]
@61630  = ~Ahhh! I have failed him!~ [FANATF08]
@61631  = ~Kneel and repent!~ [FANATM01]
@61632  = ~The pit is empty.~
@61633  = ~Cast off your old beliefs and be saved!~ [FANATM02]
@61634  = ~I am one of the few who are chosen.~ [FANATM03]
@61635  = ~Why do you persist with your false gods?~ [FANATM04]
@61636  = ~Death to the disbeliever!~ [FANATM05]
@61637  = ~~ [FANATM06]
@61638  = ~~ [FANATM07]
@61639  = ~No! My... my god will save me!~ [FANATM08]
@61640  = ~You aren't from one of the other merchants, are you? I tell you, the competition here can get something fierce at times. I've got my eye on you.~ [FEMER04]
@61641  = ~So long as you are polite, I shall tolerate you.~ [NOBFE01]
@61642  = ~Do you have something you wish to say?~ [NOBFE02]
@61643  = ~I don't usually speak to the likes of you, but... hello!~ [NOBFE03]
@61644  = ~Is it important, peasant?~ [NOBFE04]
@61645  = ~I take no pleasure in speaking to one as low as you.~ [NOBFE05]
@61646  = ~Come, come. We can't be giving charity to just anyone, you know.~ [NOBFE06]
@61647  = ~~ [NOBFE07]
@61648  = ~~ [NOBFE08]
@61649  = ~Away with you! Do not touch me!~ [NOBFE09]
@61650  = ~I am a lady of refinement, and you shall treat me as such, I am sure.~ [NOBFE201]
@61651  = ~You are a stranger to this place? I do not think I have seen you on the streets ere now.~ [NOBFE202]
