@61975  = ~I've no time to speak to one such as you.~ [GDWARF02]
@61976  = ~Beware, or ye'll be soon hangin' from yer tongue!~ [GDWARF03]
@61977  = ~I'll test your mettle with cold steel!~ [GDWARF04]
