@66202  = ~I am your mother. I am Alianna, a disciple of the great Lord of Murder, a priestess of Bhaal. In the Time of Troubles did Bhaal himself come and whisper in mine ear.~ [D1MOTH07]
@66203  = ~Also known as the Stream of Anguish, this is the legendary burning blade of Frithiof.

