With the final page of the manual restored, the full scope of the enchantments within the Manual of Golems can be unleashed, explaining how to use the manual to temporarily conjure a servant of smooth iron which will obey the creator without question. The user must have a minimum intelligence of 16 to understand the contents of the tome.

