 Cleric
 Druid
 Mage
 Sorcerer~
@70786  = ~The scepter of radiance suddenly glows brightly... It is obviously back in one piece and ready to be used.~
@70787  = ~Deathbringer Assault~
@70788  = ~When asked about his past, SAREVOK has little to add beyond what you already know. He grew up a homeless urchin in the streets until he was adopted by his foster father into the Iron Throne. He studied the art of intimidation, the cruelest and most brutal styles of combat, in order to become a Deathbringer that could paralyze an opponent in melee through fear alone... as well as sometimes killing the most powerful foes in a single, massive blow. Sarevok had an ambition that did not die even when his body did... as you well know now. Sarevok keeps mostly to himself, but at odd moments, you can see him staring in your direction, his face an emotionless mask. Part of you wonders if your brutal half-brother ponders what might have been...~
@70789  = ~So. You have finally arrived. I have been waiting for you.~ [SAREVO01]
@70790  = ~They are too strong for me. I cannot continue!~ [SAREVO02]
@70791  = ~It appears I made the right decision in joining you after all.~ [SAREVO03]
@70792  = ~Oh, we should kill something soon. My impatience grows.~ [SAREVO04]
@70793  = ~This is hardly what I expected. If this continues, I see little point in my remaining with your group... We are a poor match.~ [SAREVO05]
@70794  = ~I can take no more of this! Do what you must—I can bear your presence no longer!~ [SAREVO06]
@70795  = ~This is how it was meant to be. Let no one bar our path.~ [SAREVO07]
@70796  = ~Enough. I no longer have immortal energies to sustain me. I... tire.~ [SAREVO08]
@70797  = ~This is what you consider productive use of our time? Do you prefer we stand around like this often?~ [SAREVO09]
@70798  = ~Feel my unholy wrath!~ [SAREVO10]
@70799  = ~Death comes for you. FEEL its icy breath!~ [SAREVO11]
@70800  = ~~ [SAREVO12]
@70801  = ~Ngh!~ [SAREVO15]
@70802  = ~No! I... I refuse!~ [SAREVO16]
@70803  = ~Healing! Quickly!~ [SAREVO18]
@70804  = ~Shrubbery, flowers... Weeds, all of it!~ [SAREVO19]
@70805  = ~Ha! These are all pawns. Pawns collected for the use of whoever knows how to place them on the board.~ [SAREVO20]
@70806  = ~There is power to be found in places such as this...~ [SAREVO22]
@70807  = ~In this light, it seems all the insects that prey on the living have retreated to their shadows.~ [SAREVO23]
@70808  = ~*chuckle* Darkness is friend to all with evil intent.~ [SAREVO24]
@70809  = ~Yes?~ [SAREVO26]
@70810  = ~WHAT do you wish?~ [SAREVO27]
@70811  = ~Sarevok stands ready.~ [SAREVO28]
@70812  = ~Do not presume.~ [SAREVO29]
@70813  = ~Show me.~ [SAREVO30]
@70814  = ~I await your command.~ [SAREVO31]
@70815  = ~I fear nothing.~ [SAREVO32]
@70816  = ~~ [SAREVO33]
@70817  = ~So be it.~ [SAREVO34]
@70818  = ~I shall carve a path if need be.~ [SAREVO35]
@70819  = ~As you wish.~ [SAREVO36]
@70820  = ~Hmph. Not what I would've done.~ [SAREVO37]
@70821  = ~So you say.~ [SAREVO38]
@70822  = ~Consider it accomplished.~ [SAREVO39]
@70823  = ~What if we were to return to Baldur's Gate together? What would people say, do you think? *chuckle*~ [SAREVO40]
@70824  = ~Die!~ [SAREVO41]
@70825  = ~Bah!~ [SAREVO42]
@70826  = ~This one is invulnerable!~ [SAREVO43]
@70827  = ~Pick it up yourself—I'll carry no more.~ [SAREVO44]
@70828  = ~Whatever it had, it's mine now.~ [SAREVO45]
@70829  = ~I am as unseen as death.~ [SAREVO46]
@70830  = ~My incantations are disrupted!~ [SAREVO47]
@70831  = ~It is laid, as directed.~ [SAREVO48]
@70832  = ~We children of Bhaal cannot be stopped!~ [SAREVO13]
@70833  = ~Ha! This arena I know well!~ [SAREVO14]
@70834  = ~Nuargh...~ [SAREVO17]
@70835  = ~I have had enough of... people. They try my patience.~ [SAREVO21]
@70836  = ~Beware! Darkness is murder's most favored companion.~ [SAREVO25]
@70837  = ~*sigh* Mayhap it is time I thought of leaving. I can almost endure no more of your actions!~ [ANOM2535]
@70838  = ~Are you sure? I had enough of leadership in the Order... Oh, very well. *sigh* But it's a week vacation for everyone. *chuckle*~ [ANOM2536]
@70839  = ~A bottle of wine, a blanket, a little music as we rest... Are these things too much to ask?~ [ANOM2537]
@70840  = ~*chuckle* Hurry up and wait, hurry up and wait. Hm. Sounds like my days in the Order.~ [ANOM2538]
@70841  = ~Helm's fury upon you all!~ [ANOM2539]
@70842  = ~By skill and might, we shall prevail!~ [ANOM2540]
@70843  = ~Hmm. I don't think I have ever looked upon the bustle of the city without keeping a watchful eye out for evil. It seems... quieter.~ [ANOM2541]
@70844  = ~I am ready to act.~ [ANOM2542]
@70845  = ~Yes?~ [ANOM2543]
@70846  = ~Of course.~ [ANOM2544]
@70847  = ~Not a problem.~ [ANOM2545]
@70848  = ~*chuckle* So long as I never have to breathe the same stuffy air as those rusted suits of armor in the Order... well, I'm with you.~ [ANOM2546]
@70849  = ~*sigh* You know, there's little point in driving us to the breaking point. We should stop soon.~ [NALI2518]
@70850  = ~*sigh* I don't want to be annoying, but... I detest just standing around.~ [NALI2519]
@70851  = ~Evil falls today!~ [NALI2520]
@70852  = ~If you fight, you die! You cannot match our power!~ [NALI2521]
@70853  = ~There is evil here... but there is likely also magic that can help us, I'd bet.~ [NALI2522]
@70854  = ~I can assist you.~ [NALI2523]
@70855  = ~My magic is at your command.~ [NALI2524]
@70856  = ~It can be done.~ [NALI2525]
@70857  = ~Naturally!~ [NALI2526]
@70858  = ~Very well.~ [NALI2527]
@70859  = ~Once, all this would've been beyond my imagination. But THAT was a long time ago.~ [NALI2528]
@70860  = ~Evil cannot be allowed to fester!~ [AERI2539]
@70861  = ~Oh, this is gonna hurt you a LOT more than me!~ [AERI2540]
@70862  = ~By all that is decent, I fight!~ [AERI2541]
@70863  = ~Savings Throws Lowered~
@70864  = ~Hit Points Increased~
@70865  = ~You have the four scepters! Place them around the cage so I may be free!~
