@71043  = ~Most clubs are stout, hardwood sticks, narrow at the grip and wider at the end. This simple weapon has been used since people first began using tools. Anyone can find a good, stout piece of wood and swing it, hence the club's widespread use. This particular club has been magically enhanced.

