@71053  = ~War Hammer +3~
@71054  = ~Mounted knights cannot effectively use pole arms while on horseback, and as a result, many weapons have been altered so they may be used one-handed. The horseman's war hammer is made entirely of steel and has a shaft about eighteen inches long. Powerful magical energy flows through this weapon, though its origins are nondescript.

