@71057  = ~Longbow +3~
@71058  = ~The longbow is similar to the shortbow, except that the staff is about as tall as the archer is, usually six to six-and-a-half feet. It has better range and accuracy than the shortbow, but a slower Speed Factor. The smooth staff of this bow is warm to the touch, just a hint of the energy that surges through the wood.

