@71062  = ~A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. This particular weapon has been enchanted with an aspect of life from the Plane of Air, harnessed by a master sorcerer. The aspect acts as a guiding hand, directing bolts to strike true and for more damage than normal.

