@71067  = ~Light Crossbow +3~
@71068  = ~As you wish.~
@71069  = ~A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). This magical crossbow is elegant and light in the hand, with little recoil.

