@71083  = ~I'm sure. Just wait right here for now.~
@71084  = ~Your destiny is nearly complete.~
@71085  = ~Return me to where I was.~
@71086  = ~I am ready. It is time for the end.~
@71087  = ~Return me to where I was.~
