@71138  = ~Wong Fei's Ioun Stone~
@71139  = ~With the addition of the horns, the Helm of the Rock is even more powerful. Generals and military leaders can command both fear and respect simply by wearing this helm.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Cold Resistance: +25%
– Fire Resistance: +25%
– Acid Resistance: +25%
– Electrical Resistance: +25%
– Poison Resistance: +25%

Charge abilities:
– Aura of Command three times per day (save vs. spell at -2 negates)
  Special: Target flees in terror
  Range: 25 ft.
  Duration: 5 rounds
  Area of Effect: 1 creature

Weight: 2

Only usable by:
 Barbarian
 Fighter (except Kensai)~
@71140  = ~This ioun stone was said to be a gift given to the Shou-ling monk Wong Fei Hung by the Kara-Turan god of war, Chan Cheng. The god came down in the form of a dragon and fought Wong Fei for three days and three nights. Chan Cheng was so impressed by the monk's prowess that he bestowed the ioun stone upon him. The stone disappeared when Wong Fei died.

STATISTICS:

