@73900  = ~Peragath the Valiant, a great champion of the Order of the Radiant Heart, carried this shield into battle against a horde of invading tanar'ri pouring through a gate to the Astral Plane. Gripped by holy fervor, the mighty paladin single-handedly drove back the horde, then foolishly leapt through the astral gate to finish them off. The gate collapsed, and both Peragath and the shield were forever lost in the planes.

